WEBVTT

01:19.020 --> 01:21.900
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:22.160 --> 01:24.900
[Episode 9]

01:27.150 --> 01:27.710
Hello?

01:28.070 --> 01:29.789
Hello, Yu. Did you call me?

01:29.810 --> 01:30.680
I just woke up.

01:31.039 --> 01:32.930
Hey, are you seriously sleeping?

01:33.000 --> 01:34.680
The HR department tried calling you
but couldn't get through,

01:34.680 --> 01:36.140
so they came to me instead.

01:36.350 --> 01:36.820
HR...

01:37.150 --> 01:39.039
HR called me?

01:39.479 --> 01:40.560
What do they want?

01:41.229 --> 01:43.220
What else could it be? Good news.

01:43.280 --> 01:44.920
Congratulations—your wish just came true.

01:44.920 --> 01:45.720
Come over now.

01:46.590 --> 01:48.729
Y-You mean I've been reinstated?

01:48.759 --> 01:49.690
Is that for real?

01:50.039 --> 01:50.590
You know what?

01:50.590 --> 01:52.560
I literally just dreamed
about being reinstated.

01:52.560 --> 01:53.380
Enough talking.

01:53.380 --> 01:54.580
Come here right away.

01:56.310 --> 01:56.960
No.

01:56.979 --> 01:59.509
I'm not going to get my hopes up
like last time.

01:59.560 --> 02:01.120
I need to see Director Fang in person

02:01.120 --> 02:03.720
and hear it from her myself
before I believe it.

02:04.000 --> 02:04.750
I'll go now.

02:17.240 --> 02:19.840
Why did I call you here—
you should know, right?

02:21.360 --> 02:23.280
And why are you looking at me like that?

02:23.280 --> 02:27.150
[Marketing Director's Office]

02:24.430 --> 02:26.390
I only trust what you tell me yourself.

02:26.390 --> 02:28.710
Anything anyone else says,
I take with a grain of salt.

02:27.200 --> 02:31.040
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

02:29.520 --> 02:31.180
Your report is very valuable.

02:31.240 --> 02:33.720
You actually unearthed financial wizardry

02:32.380 --> 02:39.610
[Marketing Director's Office]

02:33.750 --> 02:35.350
of this level at Shanlifang.

02:36.700 --> 02:38.810
I just found the raw data

02:38.840 --> 02:40.290
and confirmed the extent of it.

02:40.290 --> 02:41.550
Without data support,

02:41.630 --> 02:43.430
all speculation is baseless.

02:43.630 --> 02:45.670
And you provided the supporting evidence.

02:43.660 --> 02:45.540
[Marketing Director's Office]

02:45.680 --> 02:48.490
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

02:45.960 --> 02:48.000
You proved your capability
through action.

02:48.000 --> 02:51.240
So, welcome back to He Jing and help me.

02:53.430 --> 02:54.490
Please have a seat.

02:55.270 --> 02:56.170
That's great—

02:56.840 --> 02:59.750
thank you, Director Fang,
for giving me a second chance.

02:59.750 --> 03:01.240
This time I'll give it my all

03:01.240 --> 03:03.430
and sort out all of Shanlifang's accounts,
making...

03:03.430 --> 03:05.580
Don't get ahead of yourself.

03:05.720 --> 03:06.980
You're still new here.

03:07.430 --> 03:09.280
Observe more and learn as you go.

03:11.590 --> 03:13.190
Don't think too highly of yourself—

03:13.190 --> 03:15.400
pride will make you fall hard.

03:15.560 --> 03:17.360
Alright, I'll keep that in mind.

03:17.630 --> 03:18.150
Also,

03:19.079 --> 03:20.240
we've signed
a division of responsibilities agreement

03:20.240 --> 03:21.960
with Zhizhong.

03:21.960 --> 03:23.400
Shanlifang's financial issues

03:23.400 --> 03:24.520
will be raised by them,

03:24.520 --> 03:26.150
so you shouldn't say anything
to outsiders.

03:26.150 --> 03:27.210
Do you understand?

03:27.240 --> 03:27.970
Understood.

03:28.120 --> 03:29.780
I'll just focus on my own work.

03:30.079 --> 03:30.470
Good.

03:30.630 --> 03:32.090
By the way, Director Fang,

03:32.750 --> 03:33.880
once I join the team,

03:33.960 --> 03:36.150
what will my responsibilities be?

03:36.240 --> 03:37.640
I'll prepare in advance.

03:39.630 --> 03:41.030
You'll be doing odd jobs.

03:43.970 --> 03:45.970
Alright, thank you, Director Fang.

03:48.430 --> 03:51.090
By then, just take this form
and then overall...

03:51.240 --> 03:52.180
You see...

03:52.240 --> 03:54.829
Mo Li, Zhaozhao, Zijun—

03:54.910 --> 03:55.960
I'm back.

03:56.840 --> 03:58.870
We already know! We missed you like crazy!

03:58.870 --> 04:00.240
I missed you guys like crazy too.

04:00.240 --> 04:01.100
We're truly happy
from the bottom of our hearts

04:01.100 --> 04:02.430
to see you back.

04:02.430 --> 04:03.920
It just goes to show
that as long as you work hard,

04:03.920 --> 04:05.150
the company won't fire capable people

04:05.150 --> 04:06.920
without reason.

04:06.950 --> 04:07.590
Well said.

04:07.870 --> 04:10.070
Only work never lets effort go to waste.

04:10.630 --> 04:11.710
And congratulations—

04:11.710 --> 04:13.160
you've been directly assigned
to the frontline project team.

04:13.160 --> 04:15.330
That's the core department
of our investment bank.

04:15.330 --> 04:16.630
But Director Fang just told me

04:16.630 --> 04:18.170
I'll be starting with odd jobs.

04:18.170 --> 04:20.850
Even doing odd jobs here
can still lead to limitless opportunities.

04:20.850 --> 04:21.660
Right?

04:21.680 --> 04:22.210
Qian Fei,

04:32.870 --> 04:34.190
you're pretty happy about this,
aren't you?

04:34.190 --> 04:36.040
I got transferred
so you could take my place.

04:36.040 --> 04:37.570
What are you talking about?

04:37.630 --> 04:38.680
Cut the act.

04:38.870 --> 04:40.500
This is all your doing.

04:41.060 --> 04:43.630
If you hadn't badmouthed me
in front of the director,

04:43.630 --> 04:45.800
would I have been unfairly transferred?

04:45.800 --> 04:47.400
Everyone, watch out for her.

04:47.830 --> 04:50.400
She stole my position
just to get reinstated—

04:50.510 --> 04:52.170
there's nothing she won't do.

04:53.070 --> 04:54.310
I'm living proof.

04:55.240 --> 04:57.040
What does this have to do with me?

04:59.300 --> 05:01.410
Fei, when are you going
to start onboarding?

05:01.410 --> 05:03.070
Probably in the next few days.

05:04.840 --> 05:08.850
[Line 12]

05:12.510 --> 05:13.800
I'm back.

05:24.190 --> 05:26.630
Something's off about the landlady's mood.

05:26.630 --> 05:28.030
Did Fang Yun mess with me?

05:28.310 --> 05:30.600
Was she never planning to let the landlady
return to He Jing?

05:30.600 --> 05:31.730
Still cleaning?

05:32.000 --> 05:34.200
Isn't this place already pretty clean?

05:38.920 --> 05:39.720
Hey,

05:40.680 --> 05:42.750
if you keep putting all your energy
into housework,

05:42.750 --> 05:44.430
won't you lose your drive for work?

05:44.430 --> 05:46.290
Why not hire a part-time cleaner?

05:46.630 --> 05:48.370
Housework helps me relax.

05:49.630 --> 05:50.830
That's a weird hobby.

05:52.159 --> 05:53.020
Lift your foot.

05:59.330 --> 06:00.930
Uh... I've been reinstated.

06:01.090 --> 06:03.510
Director Fang has assigned me back
to the Shanlifang Group.

06:03.510 --> 06:04.120
Really?

06:04.510 --> 06:06.850
That's great! Awesome! Awesome!

06:06.880 --> 06:07.680
Bravo!

06:09.070 --> 06:10.730
What are you so excited about?

06:11.310 --> 06:11.750
I...

06:12.700 --> 06:14.610
Y-You got reinstated,

06:14.630 --> 06:16.630
so I can have a few more dishes,
can't I?

06:16.630 --> 06:17.470
I'm so happy!

06:18.800 --> 06:20.560
But something's off—

06:20.580 --> 06:22.240
y-you don't look like someone
who just got reinstated.

06:22.240 --> 06:23.900
Why aren't you excited at all?

06:25.310 --> 06:27.040
That fearless, all-in drive you had

06:27.040 --> 06:28.950
when you were desperate
to get into Fang Yun's team—

06:28.950 --> 06:29.810
where did it go?

06:29.810 --> 06:31.160
Bring it back!

06:31.190 --> 06:33.110
Celebrate! Get fired up!

06:33.630 --> 06:35.159
I have something to ask you.

06:37.630 --> 06:38.640
What is it?

06:39.620 --> 06:42.720
Director Fang said this matter
must be kept confidential,

06:42.720 --> 06:45.850
and that you and Shanlifang
should handle it privately.

06:47.070 --> 06:47.920
Why did you take all the responsibility

06:47.920 --> 06:49.070
on yourself?

06:50.510 --> 06:51.409
Why else?

06:51.560 --> 06:54.040
Because I'm good at it.
I like being in the spotlight.

06:54.040 --> 06:55.159
Aren't you afraid

06:55.159 --> 06:57.360
you'll completely offend Shanlifang?

06:59.430 --> 07:00.430
I know.

07:03.430 --> 07:05.030
What do I have to be afraid of?

07:05.950 --> 07:08.160
People who aim big
don't sweat the small stuff.

07:08.160 --> 07:09.750
I don't care about that at all.

07:09.750 --> 07:10.680
I really don't get it—

07:10.680 --> 07:11.870
how did someone like you

07:11.870 --> 07:13.530
become a project team leader?

07:22.720 --> 07:24.050
What are you looking at?

07:26.720 --> 07:28.050
No... no... nothing...

07:31.000 --> 07:32.860
I still have something to ask you.

07:33.800 --> 07:34.730
Something else?

07:39.240 --> 07:40.510
Fine. One...

07:41.510 --> 07:43.120
One question for one meal.

07:45.950 --> 07:48.550
I can cook it—
do you even have the guts to eat it?

07:48.800 --> 07:50.159
Why wouldn't I dare?

07:51.159 --> 07:53.290
Right, you've got guts. Just no shame.

07:54.190 --> 07:55.320
What does that mean?

08:00.560 --> 08:01.060
[Authentic Da Hong Pao Tea Eggs]

08:01.090 --> 08:01.730
[Who made it for you?]

08:01.480 --> 08:01.830
Erm...

08:01.750 --> 08:02.430
[My silly apprentice made it for me
as a gesture of respect.]

08:02.310 --> 08:03.600
Didn't I set it to be visible
to specific groups?

08:03.600 --> 08:04.730
Why is this still...

08:04.850 --> 08:07.950
Maybe it's my first time doing this,
and I'm not really familiar with it yet.

08:07.950 --> 08:10.180
I suddenly don't feel so well...

08:10.510 --> 08:12.440
my lower back hurts,
my back hurts.

08:12.870 --> 08:14.530
Ugh, you're driving me crazy.

08:22.960 --> 08:24.900
Looks like no food for me.

08:29.630 --> 08:31.670
I even saved room coming back,

08:31.670 --> 08:34.150
waiting for my apprentice
to show some gratitude,

08:34.150 --> 08:36.549
thinking there'd be a feast
waiting for me.

08:36.870 --> 08:38.320
Poor me...

08:38.909 --> 08:40.039
I'm not happy at all!

09:13.440 --> 09:14.960
I made too much for dinner.

09:15.670 --> 09:17.440
Rather than dumping it in the trash,

09:17.440 --> 09:19.740
I might as well feed some passersby.

09:20.120 --> 09:22.120
If you want to eat,
come over and eat.

09:40.390 --> 09:41.630
Hurry up.

09:44.210 --> 09:45.280
Hey,

09:45.830 --> 09:48.030
I never said I wanted to eat. You just...

09:49.150 --> 09:50.080
Fine, fine.

09:55.510 --> 09:57.840
What's wrong?
Not eating separately now?

09:57.840 --> 09:59.270
What happened
to your clean freak tendencies?

09:59.270 --> 10:00.300
I'm afraid you'll poison me.

10:00.300 --> 10:02.360
It's safer to eat from the same plate.

10:02.720 --> 10:05.630
How did I end up
with such an annoying tenant like you?

10:05.630 --> 10:07.320
How did I end up with a landlady like you—

10:07.320 --> 10:09.180
so generous and such a great cook?

10:09.240 --> 10:10.870
All you know how to do is flatter people.

10:10.870 --> 10:12.320
What are you after?

10:13.330 --> 10:15.030
What could I possibly be after?

10:15.030 --> 10:16.030
No purpose at all.

10:17.030 --> 10:18.030
Eat up. Go on, eat.

10:23.080 --> 10:23.630
Who is it?

10:25.550 --> 10:26.440
Who is it?

10:31.120 --> 10:32.390
Hello, is Mr. Li here?

10:35.750 --> 10:37.750
Li Yifei, what big item
did you buy this time?

10:37.750 --> 10:38.950
It's mine. It's mine.

10:39.480 --> 10:40.590
Great, it's here.

10:40.720 --> 10:41.650
Come in, come in.

10:42.150 --> 10:43.510
Should we disassemble first
or assemble first?

10:43.510 --> 10:44.000
Disassemble first.

10:44.000 --> 10:45.600
Alright, alright—this way.

10:46.360 --> 10:47.420
What are you doing?

10:48.600 --> 10:49.510
Do all of these need to be disassembled?

10:49.510 --> 10:50.240
Yes, all of them.

10:50.240 --> 10:51.670
After disassembling them,
just help me throw them away.

10:51.670 --> 10:52.200
Okay.

10:53.870 --> 10:54.930
Li Yifei, come out.

10:55.150 --> 10:55.680
I'm busy.

10:55.690 --> 10:56.360
Come out.

11:01.840 --> 11:03.400
Careful, careful—

11:03.790 --> 11:04.520
don't hit it.

11:06.730 --> 11:07.280
What's going on?

11:07.280 --> 11:09.210
Did I agree to you changing the bed?

11:09.790 --> 11:10.510
You did.

11:10.990 --> 11:11.830
When?

11:12.390 --> 11:13.720
That time...

11:13.750 --> 11:14.910
when you were drunk.

11:15.500 --> 11:17.550
Not exactly—maybe you had
just had a few drinks, not fully drunk.

11:17.550 --> 11:18.680
You don't remember?

11:19.500 --> 11:20.170
Did I?

11:21.730 --> 11:22.790
Yeah, you forgot.

11:23.750 --> 11:24.360
Then...

11:25.480 --> 11:28.290
if I agreed, go ahead and change it.

11:28.920 --> 11:30.920
But I still don't really believe it.

11:35.120 --> 11:37.790
Would I lie about something this small?

11:38.510 --> 11:39.870
That day you told me

11:39.870 --> 11:42.840
you originally wanted,
after getting married and having kids,

11:42.840 --> 11:44.670
to use that bed in my room

11:44.670 --> 11:46.330
as a bunk bed for the children.

11:46.480 --> 11:48.480
Then later you weren't getting married,

11:48.480 --> 11:49.020
or having kids anymore,

11:49.020 --> 11:50.030
right?

11:50.390 --> 11:52.000
And seeing that bed just annoyed you.

11:52.000 --> 11:53.000
So I said, alright,

11:53.000 --> 11:54.390
I'll help you replace it

11:54.390 --> 11:55.730
for free then.

11:55.960 --> 11:57.740
Out of sight, out of mind.

11:58.020 --> 11:59.390
And you said that sounded good—

11:59.390 --> 12:00.860
and you even thanked me for it.

12:00.860 --> 12:02.390
You really forgot all that?

12:02.440 --> 12:03.670
Careful, careful.

12:03.810 --> 12:04.610
Alright then,

12:04.930 --> 12:05.980
go ahead and install it.

12:05.980 --> 12:07.470
Keep it down though—it's late.

12:07.470 --> 12:08.000
Okay.

12:09.230 --> 12:11.290
Sir, please keep the noise down a bit.

12:11.630 --> 12:12.030
Okay.

12:24.200 --> 12:26.840
Zhen fell in love with Qiang
on a starry night.

12:27.240 --> 12:31.220
on a starry night.

12:33.270 --> 12:34.610
This is so comfortable—

12:35.240 --> 12:38.300
I can finally roll around in bed
and sleep any way I want.

12:42.240 --> 12:44.860
So comfortable...

12:45.240 --> 12:46.630
You scared me.

12:48.280 --> 12:49.630
After thinking it through carefully,

12:49.630 --> 12:51.320
I don't think I ever

12:51.320 --> 12:53.720
agreed to changing the bed
when I was drunk.

12:55.510 --> 12:56.470
You did agree.

12:59.830 --> 13:01.740
I know myself well enough—

13:01.870 --> 13:04.210
I'm very careful
and calculating with money.

13:04.210 --> 13:05.650
If I had really agreed,

13:05.910 --> 13:07.630
I would definitely have discussed

13:07.630 --> 13:09.120
depreciation of the old furniture
with you.

13:09.120 --> 13:10.390
But clearly, I didn't.

13:13.600 --> 13:15.000
That actually kind of makes sense.

13:15.000 --> 13:16.200
I saw right through you a long time ago.

13:16.200 --> 13:17.360
Don't be mad... Please don't be mad.

13:17.360 --> 13:19.760
This bed is really comfortable—try it out.

13:20.440 --> 13:21.640
Landlady. Qian Fei.

13:21.750 --> 13:23.550
Don't be angry. Don't be angry.

13:23.620 --> 13:27.020
[Shanghai World Financial Center]

13:32.750 --> 13:33.480
Dang Yu.

13:45.910 --> 13:47.240
What are you doing here?

13:47.680 --> 13:49.790
Last time you said you'd contact me
when you were free,

13:49.790 --> 13:51.600
but you didn't leave any contact info.

13:51.600 --> 13:53.600
So I had to come here and wait for you.

13:54.030 --> 13:55.090
I forgot last time.

13:55.670 --> 13:56.710
What's up?

13:57.850 --> 13:59.840
Didn't we agree I'd treat you

13:59.840 --> 14:01.770
to a meal with Qian Fei and Li Yifei?

14:04.320 --> 14:06.760
I think that was the plan, yeah.

14:07.000 --> 14:08.270
So I came to ask you—

14:08.390 --> 14:10.590
are you free tomorrow night for dinner?

14:11.910 --> 14:14.320
I've got a part-time job tomorrow night.

14:15.430 --> 14:17.150
What about lunchtime?

14:18.000 --> 14:19.790
I'm busy at noon too.

14:20.360 --> 14:21.690
Let's just reschedule.

14:21.720 --> 14:22.240
No.

14:22.630 --> 14:23.960
I need

14:23.990 --> 14:25.390
to lock down a time today.

14:26.000 --> 14:26.720
Why though?

14:29.510 --> 14:30.480
Because...

14:32.270 --> 14:34.670
Last time at Qian Fei's place,
I scared her off.

14:34.670 --> 14:35.870
I want to treat her to a meal,

14:35.870 --> 14:37.730
but it doesn't feel appropriate

14:38.030 --> 14:39.000
to invite her alone.

14:39.000 --> 14:41.660
So I thought I'd have you
and Li Yifei come along.

14:53.360 --> 14:54.560
That does make sense.

14:56.670 --> 14:58.550
I knew it—why insist

14:58.570 --> 14:59.670
on a group of four?

15:00.440 --> 15:01.770
So you're trying to invite Qian Fei

15:01.770 --> 15:03.700
but too shy to say it outright, huh?

15:03.910 --> 15:06.240
-It's not exactly that...
-Alright then.

15:06.360 --> 15:07.990
Let's do it tomorrow at noon.

15:08.020 --> 15:09.590
I'll move things around,

15:09.610 --> 15:11.670
and Qian Fei should be available too.

15:12.670 --> 15:13.470
It's settled?

15:14.120 --> 15:14.750
Then...

15:17.110 --> 15:19.170
let's add each other on WeChat first.

15:26.010 --> 15:27.910
[Jun Cheng]

15:28.480 --> 15:29.000
Done.

15:30.960 --> 15:31.480
I'm off.

15:32.120 --> 15:33.120
See you tomorrow.

15:33.200 --> 15:34.200
See you tomorrow.

15:49.480 --> 15:50.910
Hi babe,

15:51.320 --> 15:52.360
did you see it?

15:54.140 --> 16:00.830
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

15:54.440 --> 15:57.000
Look—abalone, razor clams,

15:57.790 --> 15:59.510
and prawns.

16:01.200 --> 16:04.200
Then I blanched them with ginger

16:04.320 --> 16:05.320
and cooking wine.

16:06.150 --> 16:07.910
I also bought some ham.

16:09.150 --> 16:11.630
Then steamed everything for 15 minutes

16:11.630 --> 16:13.360
and poured out the remaining broth.

16:13.360 --> 16:15.840
Stop it, you're making me crave it.

16:16.080 --> 16:18.270
I want to fly back to Shanghai
right this second.

16:18.270 --> 16:20.150
Why do you always make such good food

16:18.360 --> 16:21.590
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

16:20.180 --> 16:21.540
when I'm not around?

16:22.600 --> 16:24.150
It's to celebrate my reinstatement—

16:24.150 --> 16:25.830
of course I had to splurge.

16:26.120 --> 16:27.660
Who told you and Lu Ze

16:27.680 --> 16:29.630
to go running off to a team-building event
without saying a word?

16:29.630 --> 16:30.480
Don't even mention it.

16:30.480 --> 16:32.300
I thought a free trip

16:32.330 --> 16:33.460
would be a good deal,

16:33.550 --> 16:35.440
but turns out we lost big time.

16:35.550 --> 16:38.240
Alright, I'll make it for you again
when you're back.

16:37.070 --> 16:39.200
[Wang Ruohai!]
[Shanlifang IPO coordination!]

16:38.240 --> 16:39.030
Okay?

16:40.080 --> 16:42.390
Fei, I'll leave it here—

16:42.480 --> 16:44.010
we're going to have dinner.

16:44.910 --> 16:45.770
Go ahead, then.

16:46.200 --> 16:47.860
You hang up. My hands are full.

16:48.870 --> 16:49.720
Bye.

16:52.960 --> 16:55.640
Zhen fell in love with Qiang

16:56.200 --> 17:00.000
on a starry night.

17:02.110 --> 17:04.720
An airplane streaked across the sky.

17:28.349 --> 17:29.350
Earlier you said

17:29.350 --> 17:31.480
you were worried that if Qian Fei
found out Wang Ruohai was at Shanlifang,

17:31.480 --> 17:33.000
she wouldn't go back to He Jing.

17:33.000 --> 17:34.230
Now she's already on the project—

17:34.230 --> 17:35.510
why haven't you told her yet?

17:35.510 --> 17:37.400
Aren't I just afraid she'll back out

17:37.400 --> 17:38.400
if she finds out?

17:38.920 --> 17:40.540
You don't know how hard it was

17:40.570 --> 17:41.720
for her to get into this project team.

17:41.720 --> 17:44.250
Even if it was hard,
you still need to tell her.

17:45.640 --> 17:47.240
If she finds out you knowingly
kept it from her,

17:47.240 --> 17:48.860
I don't know how you're going
to smooth things over with her.

17:48.860 --> 17:50.510
What, you think I can't
smooth things over with her?

17:50.510 --> 17:52.540
So you think I'm wrong, huh?

17:53.220 --> 17:54.720
No—I really don't.

17:54.750 --> 17:56.540
How could I think you're wrong?

17:56.690 --> 17:58.500
You're right,
everything you do is right.

17:58.500 --> 18:00.030
How could you ever be wrong?

18:01.270 --> 18:02.510
Cheers!

18:03.100 --> 18:05.760
Thank the heavens—
you're finally back at work!

18:11.000 --> 18:12.460
Let me grab a piece of meat.

18:13.000 --> 18:14.260
How is it? Good, right?

18:15.200 --> 18:17.320
This is insanely good.

18:17.830 --> 18:19.680
I love cooking for someone like you.

18:19.680 --> 18:20.680
I'm really happy.

18:20.720 --> 18:22.350
You've already rated my cooking

18:22.350 --> 18:23.480
with your actions.

18:23.680 --> 18:25.960
Does your cooking
still need a rating system?

18:25.960 --> 18:27.270
Didn't Wang Ruohai praise your cooking

18:27.270 --> 18:28.480
all the time when you were with him?

18:28.480 --> 18:30.400
We already broke up—why bring him up?

18:30.400 --> 18:31.750
You should've broken up a long time ago.

18:31.750 --> 18:34.350
You two were never right
for each other anyway.

18:34.920 --> 18:36.400
From my experience,

18:36.870 --> 18:38.120
if you're going to find a husband,

18:38.120 --> 18:41.000
you should find someone
who appreciates your strengths—

18:41.000 --> 18:42.100
someone whose tastes match yours,

18:42.100 --> 18:44.430
and who you can actually enjoy meals with.

18:47.070 --> 18:48.850
Don't you always make those
deep-fried eggplant strips?

18:48.850 --> 18:50.070
I've seen you add this before—

18:50.070 --> 18:51.280
it tastes really good.

18:51.280 --> 18:53.120
Just make more then—I love it.

18:55.770 --> 18:56.420
[Authentic Da Hong Pao Tea Eggs]

18:56.450 --> 18:57.360
[My silly apprentice made it for me
as a gesture of respect.]

18:56.820 --> 18:58.530
Didn't I set it to be visible
to specific groups?

18:58.530 --> 18:59.660
Why is this still...

19:00.110 --> 19:02.350
Maybe it's my first time doing this,
and I'm not really familiar with it yet.

19:02.350 --> 19:04.770
What kind of heavenly food is this—
it smells amazing!

19:04.770 --> 19:06.720
I've decided I don't even
want those side dishes anymore—

19:06.720 --> 19:08.250
I'm swapping them for this.

19:08.880 --> 19:10.140
What are you thinking?

19:13.000 --> 19:14.070
So according to your life experience,

19:14.070 --> 19:16.440
you're saying you should find a boyfriend

19:16.440 --> 19:17.920
who thinks your instant noodles

19:17.920 --> 19:18.860
are delicious?

19:19.070 --> 19:20.720
Instant noodles aren't healthy though.

19:20.720 --> 19:23.520
I can't cook, but I can
still order takeout, right?

19:24.720 --> 19:26.250
Just pack up the leftovers.

19:26.250 --> 19:28.290
I'll do all the dishes today.

19:28.400 --> 19:29.580
Why are you so nice?

19:29.830 --> 19:31.360
Come over in a couple of days

19:31.370 --> 19:32.900
and I'll cook for you again.

19:33.030 --> 19:36.350
So you just want someone to come
help you wash dishes for free, huh?

19:36.350 --> 19:39.150
Fine—can't always
just eat your food for nothing.

19:52.830 --> 19:54.590
Alright, I've packed up the leftovers.

19:54.590 --> 19:56.790
Then I'll leave it to you.
I'm not dealing with it anymore.

19:56.790 --> 19:57.750
Go rest up.

20:07.270 --> 20:08.640
I made too much dinner.

20:08.750 --> 20:10.240
If you haven't eaten yet,
you can come back and get some,

20:09.530 --> 20:15.190
[Lujiazui Dongyuan Subdistrict Office]

20:10.440 --> 20:11.840
so it doesn't go to waste.

20:15.440 --> 20:17.920
In the spirit of saving the planet,

20:18.240 --> 20:20.240
I can reluctantly come back
and help you

20:20.240 --> 20:22.270
deal with this food surplus crisis.

20:27.070 --> 20:28.200
No need.

20:28.400 --> 20:31.460
There are stray dogs downstairs
that are still hungry.

20:32.750 --> 20:34.590
Stop—it's all mine.

20:38.480 --> 20:40.710
How can you compete with dogs for food?

20:43.720 --> 20:47.050
Aren't I even more miserable
than a stray dog—being single?

20:47.880 --> 20:49.590
Fine. The kibble's yours.

20:49.590 --> 20:52.190
How's that?
I cleaned up pretty fast, didn't I?

20:54.030 --> 20:55.630
What are you grinning about?

20:56.640 --> 20:57.330
Uh...

20:58.200 --> 21:01.530
I just scored a pack of tissues
in a flash sale—really cheap.

21:02.110 --> 21:03.550
You're grinning like a dummy.

21:03.550 --> 21:06.280
I even bought these for you—
remember to use them.

21:06.830 --> 21:07.660
Love you.

21:08.270 --> 21:11.200
These work really well.
Be nicer to yourself from now on.

21:11.200 --> 21:12.000
Got it.

21:15.400 --> 21:17.880
But still, it's been so long
since your breakup.

21:17.880 --> 21:19.510
Have you thought about

21:19.510 --> 21:21.760
looking around for someone new?

21:22.790 --> 21:23.750
No interest.

21:24.400 --> 21:25.750
No interest?
That won't do.

21:25.750 --> 21:27.060
You're still young—

21:27.240 --> 21:28.390
you can't just stop dating

21:28.390 --> 21:29.720
because of one scumbag.

21:31.550 --> 21:33.080
You're really weird.

21:33.100 --> 21:36.550
You're not even worried about yourself,
but you're worried about me?

21:36.550 --> 21:37.070
I...

21:38.110 --> 21:39.610
You've got something to say, don't you?

21:39.610 --> 21:41.270
Stop beating around the bush.

21:45.680 --> 21:47.790
Someone wants to take you out for dinner.

21:47.790 --> 21:48.350
Who?

21:52.140 --> 21:56.680
[Lujiazui Dongyuan Subdistrict Office]

21:56.240 --> 21:58.240
So what are you treating me to today?

21:58.510 --> 22:00.270
Which girl are you texting again?

22:00.270 --> 22:01.530
What girl?

22:01.790 --> 22:03.450
I'm not eating with you today.

22:03.590 --> 22:06.750
The landlady saved me some dishes—
I'm going back to eat it.

22:06.750 --> 22:08.440
You're seriously the type
to value romance over friendship, huh?

22:08.440 --> 22:10.290
I already told my mom
I'm not going home for dinner.

22:10.290 --> 22:12.000
If I go back now,
there won't be anything to eat.

22:12.000 --> 22:14.720
Your mom's not going to let you starve—
what are you afraid of?

22:14.720 --> 22:17.250
I just came by on the way
to check on you anyway.

22:17.880 --> 22:20.750
You're still as strong as ever—

22:20.770 --> 22:22.750
healthy and full of color. I'm relieved.

22:22.750 --> 22:23.610
Go home and eat.

22:25.510 --> 22:28.240
Be honest...
do you actually like your landlady?

22:29.510 --> 22:31.190
With my standards?

22:31.400 --> 22:32.860
You think I'd fall for her?

22:32.880 --> 22:34.720
Bystanders see more clearly
than those involved.

22:34.720 --> 22:36.110
Let me break it down for you.

22:36.110 --> 22:37.550
When I ate at your place last time,

22:37.550 --> 22:38.880
I felt something was off.

22:38.880 --> 22:40.640
Didn't you notice

22:40.660 --> 22:42.310
you didn't even eat separately?

22:42.310 --> 22:43.000
Did I?

22:44.350 --> 22:45.480
Must've forgotten.

22:46.680 --> 22:48.080
Alright, one more thing.

22:48.240 --> 22:49.510
When you're driving,

22:49.510 --> 22:51.750
the only girls you let sit in the front
passenger seat are the ones you like.

22:51.750 --> 22:53.530
Everyone else goes in the back.

22:53.920 --> 22:55.580
Where does your landlady sit?

22:55.680 --> 22:57.010
She definitely sits...

23:01.340 --> 23:02.490
i-in the front seat.

23:03.480 --> 23:04.410
Exactly, right?

23:08.590 --> 23:09.680
That... that's because

23:09.680 --> 23:11.610
I borrowed the car from our butler.

23:11.660 --> 23:12.860
There's no such rule.

23:13.440 --> 23:14.720
This has nothing to do with the car—

23:14.720 --> 23:16.120
it's your subconscious.

23:16.960 --> 23:19.640
The fact you don't even know
whether you like her

23:19.640 --> 23:21.020
means you already do.

23:21.160 --> 23:22.180
Nonsense.

23:22.460 --> 23:24.070
You, a lifelong single guy,

23:24.070 --> 23:25.090
are trying to analyze me,

23:25.090 --> 23:26.480
a dating expert now?

23:26.510 --> 23:28.840
Are you getting a little full of yourself?

23:29.220 --> 23:30.550
Go home and eat already.

23:31.680 --> 23:33.270
Don't forget about dinner tomorrow.

23:33.270 --> 23:35.350
I remember. Your treat and my bill.

23:35.550 --> 23:36.240
I'm leaving.

23:36.240 --> 23:36.640
Bye.

23:37.440 --> 23:38.200
Him and me?

23:38.270 --> 23:39.640
How is that possible?

23:40.480 --> 23:42.070
Why not?

23:42.720 --> 23:44.270
You all know each other.

23:44.270 --> 23:45.030
Besides, he said

23:45.030 --> 23:46.680
he wanted to make up
for the awkwardness last time,

23:46.680 --> 23:48.680
so he'd like to invite you
to dinner privately

23:48.680 --> 23:50.000
to apologize.

23:50.200 --> 23:51.480
I think it's a pretty good opportunity.

23:51.480 --> 23:53.240
We can all just eat and hang out together.

23:53.240 --> 23:56.770
You might as well get to know him better,
and who knows, maybe...

23:57.000 --> 23:58.670
He didn't even tell me.

23:59.200 --> 24:01.260
He was just embarrassed. That's all.

24:01.480 --> 24:02.640
When did he tell you?

24:03.070 --> 24:06.000
He actually came to me after work today.

24:06.270 --> 24:08.000
He was really sincere about it.

24:08.270 --> 24:10.270
He actually went to see you himself?

24:12.270 --> 24:13.270
No, that won't do.

24:14.400 --> 24:15.140
I...

24:15.160 --> 24:16.160
I don't have time.

24:16.550 --> 24:18.590
Come on, it's the weekend tomorrow.

24:19.400 --> 24:21.000
I'm really not interested.

24:21.200 --> 24:23.230
You're not even interested
in going for a meal?

24:23.230 --> 24:24.560
Worst case,

24:24.580 --> 24:26.910
you just treat it
like a free fancy dinner.

24:26.960 --> 24:28.420
A free fancy dinner for me?

24:29.400 --> 24:32.060
Feels more like
he gets 3 free meals a day from me.

24:34.880 --> 24:35.880
I'm done talking.

24:36.110 --> 24:38.390
I already moved my plans for tomorrow—

24:38.550 --> 24:40.350
I kind of want that free meal too.

24:40.920 --> 24:42.180
So just the three of us?

24:42.720 --> 24:43.630
Oh right, I forgot to tell you—

24:43.630 --> 24:44.890
there are four people:

24:45.110 --> 24:46.440
you, me, Jun Cheng,

24:47.790 --> 24:48.620
and Li Yifei.

24:52.530 --> 24:54.810
He... actually likes me?

24:55.590 --> 24:57.190
Or is this some kind of prank?

24:57.200 --> 24:58.480
What prank?

24:58.480 --> 25:01.280
He's a pretty good guy—very sincere.

25:01.880 --> 25:03.360
He has sincere moments?

25:03.930 --> 25:06.620
That's why people
need to get to know each other.

25:10.500 --> 25:12.900
I still... no.

25:13.520 --> 25:15.440
We're already this familiar—
what's the point of dinner?

25:15.440 --> 25:16.790
Don't you think it's weird?

25:16.790 --> 25:18.830
Oh please—it's just dinner.

25:18.830 --> 25:20.660
Stop dragging your feet.

25:20.690 --> 25:21.740
Are you in or not?

25:22.750 --> 25:24.830
Fine, fine, I'll go.

25:25.400 --> 25:27.480
But I'm only going

25:27.480 --> 25:29.550
because I'm getting a free meal with you.

25:29.550 --> 25:31.550
Alright, alright, as long as you go.

25:34.550 --> 25:36.680
So what are you going to wear tomorrow?

25:37.310 --> 25:37.960
No idea.

25:47.960 --> 25:50.240
How long have you
been wearing these outfits?

25:50.240 --> 25:52.090
From your college days?

25:53.440 --> 25:54.370
And this one too—

25:54.510 --> 25:57.770
it's all warped from washing,
and you're still keeping it.

26:00.640 --> 26:01.820
Oh my god,

26:03.070 --> 26:03.900
what is this?

26:04.480 --> 26:05.650
Barbie pink?

26:06.640 --> 26:07.690
Flamingo?

26:07.960 --> 26:09.490
How old are you, seriously?

26:12.200 --> 26:13.680
Doesn't it look fine?

26:15.030 --> 26:15.940
And this?

26:16.100 --> 26:18.300
Did a dragon fruit just walk off a plate?

26:18.960 --> 26:19.980
What even is all this?

26:19.980 --> 26:20.680
I'm begging you—

26:20.680 --> 26:23.010
just throw away anything in these colors.

26:24.400 --> 26:26.440
Hey, are you helping me pick clothes

26:26.440 --> 26:28.900
or doing a full-on declutter intervention?

26:31.510 --> 26:33.040
This outfit's okay though.

26:33.880 --> 26:35.680
You actually bought this brand?

26:36.030 --> 26:37.290
Jingjing gave it to me.

26:38.880 --> 26:40.150
I knew it.

26:40.960 --> 26:41.500
This one works.

26:41.500 --> 26:42.560
Let's go with this.

26:43.210 --> 26:43.740
The...

26:44.720 --> 26:45.640
puff sleeves?

26:45.660 --> 26:48.390
Isn't this a bit inappropriate
for the occasion?

26:48.620 --> 26:49.600
What's wrong with puff sleeves?

26:49.600 --> 26:51.110
So what if they're puff sleeves?

26:51.110 --> 26:52.240
A guy

26:52.260 --> 26:54.120
sincerely invited you to dinner—

26:54.200 --> 26:55.720
can you take it seriously?

27:00.440 --> 27:01.410
This is it.

27:01.480 --> 27:03.120
I don't see it that way.

27:04.310 --> 27:07.370
Alright, it's just a dinner anyway.

27:07.510 --> 27:09.590
I'll be there to keep things lively—

27:09.590 --> 27:11.390
there won't be any awkwardness.

27:11.480 --> 27:12.590
Alright, alright.

27:13.100 --> 27:14.070
I'm counting on you.

27:14.070 --> 27:15.920
It's getting late. I'm heading out.

27:15.920 --> 27:17.060
Otherwise, I will miss my ride.

27:17.060 --> 27:17.680
Okay.

27:19.350 --> 27:19.960
I...

27:21.480 --> 27:24.010
-What a coincidence.
-When did you come back?

27:24.720 --> 27:27.180
And you just sat here
without making a sound?

27:32.880 --> 27:33.840
Alright, I'm heading off.

27:33.840 --> 27:34.480
-Okay.
-Bye.

27:34.480 --> 27:36.080
Bye, bye—careful on the way.

27:49.880 --> 27:50.400
Come in.

27:52.350 --> 27:52.750
I—

27:59.480 --> 28:00.160
You're not

28:00.510 --> 28:03.310
actually planning to wear that
to dinner, are you?

28:03.310 --> 28:04.570
What's wrong? Can't I?

28:04.920 --> 28:05.640
That's it?

28:07.000 --> 28:07.960
Seriously?

28:09.000 --> 28:10.800
You're a walking turkey in that!

28:10.880 --> 28:11.510
Let go.

28:11.750 --> 28:12.810
You're the turkey.

28:12.950 --> 28:13.750
I'm not going.

28:14.640 --> 28:16.000
Good. Don't go then!

28:16.350 --> 28:18.180
I thought you were busy with work,

28:18.180 --> 28:20.590
turns out your brain's been stuck
on this kind of stuff.

28:20.590 --> 28:21.250
Look at you.

28:21.550 --> 28:23.330
You just broke up and you're already
rushing into a blind date?

28:23.330 --> 28:24.180
You just left one scumbag

28:24.180 --> 28:25.350
and now heading straight for another?

28:25.350 --> 28:27.280
You really don't get tired, do you?

28:29.000 --> 28:30.530
Alright—
since you're not going, I can relax.

28:30.530 --> 28:31.680
Li Yifei,

28:32.000 --> 28:33.640
are you crazy or what?

28:34.550 --> 28:35.830
Are you testing me?

28:36.440 --> 28:37.570
Why would I test you?

28:38.310 --> 28:39.550
You were the one who invited me.

28:39.550 --> 28:41.440
And you were the one
calling yourself a scumbag.

28:41.440 --> 28:43.790
Messing with me and scheming
at home every day is one thing—

28:43.790 --> 28:46.070
but you even went to Dang Yu
to arrange a dinner?

28:46.070 --> 28:47.870
And you even said you're into me?

28:48.270 --> 28:49.680
Is it really that fun to mess with me?

28:49.680 --> 28:50.620
Is it fun?

28:51.030 --> 28:52.760
Get out. I don't want to see you.

28:52.960 --> 28:54.590
-No, wait—hold on.
-Get out.

28:54.590 --> 28:55.240
Wait...

28:56.680 --> 28:58.540
So I called myself a scumbag—

28:58.960 --> 29:00.110
and said I like you?

29:09.020 --> 29:10.290
I get it now...

29:12.310 --> 29:13.550
I understand—I know what's going on now!

29:13.550 --> 29:15.000
Are you insane?

29:17.030 --> 29:19.100
[Yu]

29:30.460 --> 29:31.540
[Yu]

29:35.460 --> 29:37.020
It was Jun Cheng who invited you.

29:37.020 --> 29:38.420
Did I not make that clear?

29:38.640 --> 29:39.970
Who did you think it was?

29:47.180 --> 29:49.170
Oh... so it was all a misunderstanding—

29:49.170 --> 29:50.630
just a misunderstanding.

29:54.110 --> 29:55.940
I, Li Yifei,

29:56.110 --> 29:59.200
have never been
so wrongly accused in my life.

30:00.160 --> 30:01.920
I'm so miserable.

30:01.920 --> 30:04.090
I was this close
to being wrongly accused—

30:04.090 --> 30:06.220
and I'd never have lived it down.

30:07.920 --> 30:10.320
Aren't you going to make it up
to me somehow?

30:36.440 --> 30:38.040
My apologies, my apologies.

30:39.000 --> 30:40.180
Look, it was a misunderstanding—

30:40.180 --> 30:41.680
I thought you were inviting me to dinner,

30:41.680 --> 30:42.790
and that you...

30:43.070 --> 30:44.410
I had feelings for you?

30:44.440 --> 30:45.240
Right. Right.

30:45.480 --> 30:46.880
You're overthinking it.

30:46.920 --> 30:48.850
Yes, I have indeed overthought it.

30:49.680 --> 30:50.480
It's nothing.

30:50.790 --> 30:52.790
If you think about it all day,
it's easy to misunderstand things.

30:52.790 --> 30:53.270
I get it.

30:53.920 --> 30:54.830
What do you mean?

30:54.830 --> 30:55.240
Are...

30:55.960 --> 30:58.020
Are you saying I have feeling for you?

30:58.310 --> 31:00.480
You're reading way too much
into this—I really don't.

31:00.480 --> 31:01.070
Well,

31:01.480 --> 31:03.720
I really don't have the time
or energy to like anyone,

31:03.720 --> 31:04.650
so you can relax.

31:04.680 --> 31:05.720
I swear to God—

31:05.740 --> 31:07.830
if I ever had any ulterior motives
toward you,

31:07.830 --> 31:08.770
may I be struck by lightning.

31:08.770 --> 31:09.830
Alright, alright,

31:10.510 --> 31:11.710
no need to go that far.

31:12.480 --> 31:14.410
I'll take your word for it—for now.

31:14.640 --> 31:16.440
But I should clarify something:

31:17.400 --> 31:19.440
Jun isn't interested in you either.

31:19.960 --> 31:21.760
Jun is not interested in anyone.

31:22.030 --> 31:24.290
The only thing Jun cares about is gaming.

31:25.680 --> 31:27.200
When he said he'd treat you to dinner,

31:27.200 --> 31:29.160
he literally just meant a simple meal.

31:29.160 --> 31:29.860
Got it?

31:30.350 --> 31:31.150
Got it, got it.

31:31.510 --> 31:32.720
Oh Yu, honestly—

31:32.740 --> 31:34.110
she's been juggling too many roles
for too long,

31:34.110 --> 31:36.840
so it's easy to misread
other people's kindness.

31:38.590 --> 31:40.990
Now that I know
you're not interested in me,

31:41.880 --> 31:43.040
I'm relieved.

31:43.640 --> 31:45.050
What's that supposed to mean?

31:45.050 --> 31:46.300
What's wrong with me?

31:47.350 --> 31:50.050
I mean, being landlady and tenant

31:50.160 --> 31:52.270
plus work partners—

31:52.350 --> 31:53.960
that's already enough for me.

31:53.960 --> 31:55.420
Add anything on top of that

31:55.480 --> 31:57.210
and I'd completely break down.

31:59.270 --> 32:00.120
Here, Montor,

32:00.400 --> 32:01.590
I toast to you.

32:01.660 --> 32:02.830
We drink this,

32:02.880 --> 32:03.720
and tonight

32:03.750 --> 32:04.790
never happened.

32:05.160 --> 32:05.740
Cheers.

32:11.110 --> 32:12.240
Let's switch games.

32:12.480 --> 32:13.340
Still playing?

32:13.400 --> 32:13.930
Come on.

32:13.960 --> 32:14.570
Still drinking?

32:14.570 --> 32:15.050
Come on.

32:15.200 --> 32:15.920
Alright,

32:15.960 --> 32:17.490
three, two, one—look here.

32:17.920 --> 32:18.510
Come on, start.

32:18.510 --> 32:20.040
Three, two, one—look here.

32:20.400 --> 32:21.420
You lost.

32:21.680 --> 32:24.640
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

32:25.620 --> 32:29.150
♪ You always bump into my little secrets ♪

32:29.950 --> 32:31.490
♪ In my eyebrows and eyelashes ♪

32:32.060 --> 32:33.560
♪ In the curve of my lips, in my hair ♪

32:34.040 --> 32:36.070
♪ Like the raindrops in spring I like ♪

32:36.660 --> 32:38.310
♪ Or the kitten in the afternoon ♪

32:38.920 --> 32:42.510
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

32:43.450 --> 32:46.760
♪ You always easily arouse my desire
to protect you ♪

32:47.650 --> 32:48.900
♪ Seeing through my secret thoughts ♪

32:49.620 --> 32:51.150
♪ My hesitation, and my moody side ♪

32:51.770 --> 32:53.710
♪ Like the beer and fried chicken
in autumn I like ♪

32:54.410 --> 32:55.720
♪ And the spicy fish in winter ♪

32:56.430 --> 32:59.990
♪ Why is it you again?
In such a sweet tone ♪

33:00.620 --> 33:04.570
♪ It's like the whole world knows
I miss you ♪

33:05.300 --> 33:08.670
♪ Why is it always you?
With a cool chuckle ♪

33:09.440 --> 33:13.120
♪ Let me play along and protect you ♪

33:13.710 --> 33:17.250
♪ Why is it always you,
with that smile on your lips ♪

33:18.040 --> 33:21.850
♪ I blurt out I like you,
and I only like you ♪

33:22.050 --> 33:24.380
Landlady, I have to say—

33:26.000 --> 33:28.460
you're actually pretty cute
when you drink.

33:28.510 --> 33:30.350
You're not like your usual self at all.

33:30.350 --> 33:32.720
Normally you're way too much of a tomboy.

33:33.060 --> 33:33.780
A bit of...

33:37.110 --> 33:38.240
Hey, are you asleep?

33:44.590 --> 33:45.930
This is all you can handle,

33:45.930 --> 33:48.530
and you were still talking tough
at me earlier.

33:49.000 --> 33:50.480
Fine, I'll help you out.

33:51.240 --> 33:53.310
Come on, put your arm around me.

33:53.400 --> 33:53.930
Alright—

33:54.480 --> 33:55.190
let's go.

33:55.190 --> 33:56.100
Come on, get up.

33:56.550 --> 33:58.550
One, two, three...

34:49.510 --> 34:52.510
Why do I suddenly find
my landlady kind of attractive?

34:57.030 --> 34:57.710
Alcohol.

34:59.150 --> 35:00.500
It must be the alcohol.

35:00.710 --> 35:02.510
I might have alcohol poisoning.

35:02.550 --> 35:03.350
No way. No way.

35:24.180 --> 35:25.390
[Yifei]

35:30.480 --> 35:31.030
Hello?

35:32.000 --> 35:34.330
What's going on
in the middle of the night?

35:34.900 --> 35:36.300
Something big happened.

35:37.150 --> 35:38.240
You were right—

35:41.480 --> 35:43.680
I think I've fallen for the landlady.

36:03.070 --> 36:04.400
What are you looking at?

36:05.230 --> 36:07.630
Why aren't you wearing
that turkey outfit today?

36:07.630 --> 36:09.240
Didn't I already tell you yesterday—

36:09.240 --> 36:11.700
after that drink,
don't bring this up again.

36:11.800 --> 36:14.260
Alright, alright—
I won't bring it up again.

36:15.630 --> 36:16.560
But honestly...

36:17.250 --> 36:19.710
you actually look
quite pleasant like this.

36:20.550 --> 36:22.880
This is just how I dress
when I take the bus.

36:23.630 --> 36:25.400
Alright, this is you.

36:26.000 --> 36:26.530
Let's go.

36:28.070 --> 36:30.400
Do you even know
how drunk you got last night?

36:30.400 --> 36:32.880
I'm really sorry
about what happened last time.

36:32.880 --> 36:35.760
Today I'd like to formally apologize

36:35.760 --> 36:36.550
to Madam Qian and Madam Dang.

36:36.550 --> 36:38.480
Sorry for the trouble I caused you.

36:39.000 --> 36:39.280
Look at him.

36:39.280 --> 36:40.940
Madam? What are you implying?

36:41.070 --> 36:42.070
Sorry I mean Miss.

36:43.320 --> 36:45.030
Miss. Miss.

36:46.030 --> 36:47.570
If you hadn't brought it up,
I would've completely forgotten about it.

36:47.570 --> 36:48.440
That's great.

36:49.590 --> 36:50.360
Have a seat.

36:55.190 --> 36:57.250
Order first—see what you want to eat.

36:58.590 --> 37:00.990
Let Qian Fei order.
I'm fine with anything.

37:04.720 --> 37:06.750
You should take a look too. It's my treat.

37:06.750 --> 37:07.770
That's rare—

37:07.930 --> 37:09.710
Jun has never once treated us.

37:10.190 --> 37:11.210
Mostly because

37:11.230 --> 37:12.830
all his money is with his mom.

37:16.290 --> 37:17.750
What game are you playing?

37:20.070 --> 37:22.070
Come on, she's just playing a game—
why you gotta go crowd her like that?

37:22.070 --> 37:23.790
Done ordering—take a look.

37:24.280 --> 37:25.150
Go ahead with the order.

37:25.150 --> 37:26.320
I... No, I'll pass that. I don't dare.

37:26.320 --> 37:27.380
Then I'll place it.

37:33.280 --> 37:34.360
Hey, what are you doing?

37:34.360 --> 37:34.930
Wait...

37:35.150 --> 37:36.810
Wait, wait, your username...

37:37.150 --> 37:38.300
Your username...

37:39.510 --> 37:40.230
What are you doing?

37:40.230 --> 37:41.160
What's going on?

37:42.070 --> 37:42.780
Hey. What are you doing?

37:42.780 --> 37:43.840
What are you doing?

37:44.030 --> 37:45.030
-Let go. Let go.
-What are you doing?

37:45.030 --> 37:46.630
-What are you doing? Hey—behave!
-No!

37:46.630 --> 37:47.630
What are you doing?

37:47.630 --> 37:48.160
She is...

37:48.320 --> 37:49.720
In public, seriously...

37:50.070 --> 37:50.820
She is...

37:51.070 --> 37:52.360
No matter who she is, you can't do that.

37:52.360 --> 37:52.890
She is...

37:54.000 --> 37:56.480
-Behave yourself. It's public.
-You want another shoulder throw?

37:56.480 --> 37:58.880
She is "Bad Name Took Me Forever."

37:59.960 --> 38:01.280
Hey behave, or I'll beat you up.

38:01.280 --> 38:02.410
Oh, she's your idol.

38:02.550 --> 38:04.630
-Yes, Bad Name! The streamer...
-I remember. I know.

38:04.630 --> 38:05.000
-I watch every day.
-Right, right.

38:05.000 --> 38:06.690
-Still, no need for this—calm down.
-He watches my stream.

38:06.690 --> 38:08.040
I can't calm down. No.

38:08.310 --> 38:09.080
Hey,

38:09.110 --> 38:10.590
it's in public. Behave yourself.

38:10.590 --> 38:11.850
Look how excited he is.

38:12.070 --> 38:12.670
I am...

38:14.150 --> 38:15.070
I am the Prime Minister.

38:15.070 --> 38:16.070
He is your fanboy.

38:16.800 --> 38:17.320
What?

38:18.000 --> 38:19.110
The Prime Minister!

38:19.110 --> 38:20.360
You are the Prime Minister?

38:20.360 --> 38:21.760
Yes, the Prime Minister.

38:24.920 --> 38:25.400
No.

38:26.420 --> 38:28.510
-Behave yourself.
-The one who shot blindly.

38:28.510 --> 38:29.360
Okay, that checks out.

38:29.360 --> 38:30.110
Alright, cool.

38:30.110 --> 38:31.170
Let's eat. Come on.

38:32.110 --> 38:34.150
Wait... how can that even be a woman?

38:34.150 --> 38:36.150
What's wrong with her
being a woman?

38:36.400 --> 38:37.860
I'm going to the bathroom.

38:39.170 --> 38:39.830
Look at you.

38:40.480 --> 38:41.590
Calm down, calm down, calm down.

38:41.590 --> 38:42.840
-I can't calm down.
-Calm down.

38:42.840 --> 38:44.440
Do you still want there
to be a next time?

38:44.440 --> 38:45.920
Don't end up getting thrown
over the shoulder again, I'm warning you.

38:45.920 --> 38:46.610
Calm down, calm down.

38:46.610 --> 38:47.340
Oh, my god...

38:48.470 --> 38:50.050
Alright, calm now?

38:51.250 --> 38:52.040
It's fine.

38:52.070 --> 38:54.280
-I'll head off first, babe. Eat more.
-So she's your idol. It's great...

38:54.280 --> 38:55.590
-I'll make it up to you later.
-To have a dinner with your idol later.

38:55.590 --> 38:56.670
No need, really no need.

38:56.670 --> 38:57.190
Calm down, calm down.

38:57.190 --> 38:59.710
-Behave. Life is full of surprises.
-Well...

38:59.710 --> 39:00.510
She already ran.

39:00.510 --> 39:01.130
See?

39:01.510 --> 39:02.390
What did I say?

39:02.670 --> 39:04.680
See? You scared her off.

39:04.710 --> 39:06.440
Told you not to get so worked up.

39:06.670 --> 39:07.650
You guys eat.

39:07.680 --> 39:08.740
What are you doing?

39:09.230 --> 39:12.160
D-Don't go getting thrown over
your shoulder again!

39:17.800 --> 39:18.480
Bad Name.

39:18.920 --> 39:21.380
You're not even eating—
where are you going?

39:21.710 --> 39:23.250
I've got a part-time job—
I just forgot about it.

39:23.250 --> 39:24.180
Let me drive you.

39:24.360 --> 39:26.000
No need. I'll just take a taxi.

39:26.000 --> 39:26.930
A part-time job?

39:27.030 --> 39:28.880
You're already a front desk receptionist,
a bar bartender,

39:28.880 --> 39:29.920
and a livestream host—

39:29.920 --> 39:31.390
and you still have a part-time job?

39:31.390 --> 39:33.040
That's amazing!

39:33.630 --> 39:35.960
Don't fall for me—I'm just a legend.

39:38.230 --> 39:38.840
Bad Name.

39:39.320 --> 39:40.480
W-What?

39:43.590 --> 39:44.590
I admire you

39:44.610 --> 39:46.190
like the endless river,

39:46.190 --> 39:49.230
like the Yellow River bursting its banks—
once it starts, it never stops.

39:49.230 --> 39:50.440
I never thought the master player

39:50.440 --> 39:51.920
I've been thinking about day and night

39:51.920 --> 39:54.540
would be right in front of me.

39:54.840 --> 39:55.710
My admiration

39:55.710 --> 39:57.110
is about to break through gravity

39:57.110 --> 39:58.000
and reach the heavens!

39:58.000 --> 39:59.570
You're like the bright moon
in the heavens—

39:59.570 --> 40:00.770
impossible to reach.

40:01.070 --> 40:01.710
Bad Name!

40:01.710 --> 40:02.770
What are you doing?

40:04.620 --> 40:05.910
I've had that speech

40:06.040 --> 40:07.710
memorized for a long time.

40:07.840 --> 40:09.500
I always dreamed

40:09.530 --> 40:10.900
of saying it to you in person one day.

40:10.900 --> 40:11.480
Yes!

40:14.190 --> 40:15.320
-Please...
-What is he doing?

40:15.320 --> 40:16.360
Give me a chance

40:16.360 --> 40:17.790
to get close to my idol—

40:17.880 --> 40:19.140
let me drive you, okay?

40:24.110 --> 40:27.350
I... I've received your admiration.

40:27.630 --> 40:28.960
Go home early.

40:28.960 --> 40:29.550
Bad Name!

40:30.840 --> 40:32.710
Let me drive you, please!

40:34.150 --> 40:35.170
Where's the car?

40:35.320 --> 40:35.980
Over there.

40:36.670 --> 40:37.590
Let's go.

40:39.320 --> 40:40.450
Where are you going?

40:40.800 --> 40:42.600
Go, go, go! Let's get out of here!

40:46.960 --> 40:49.360
I've been meaning
to tell you for a while,

40:49.360 --> 40:52.090
but I didn't say it
because I felt a bit bad for you.

40:52.800 --> 40:55.670
Now that Gui Lili
doesn't live here anymore,

40:56.150 --> 40:57.740
and both of us are single,

40:58.590 --> 41:00.400
continuing to share this place...

41:00.400 --> 41:00.800
i-it's really

41:00.800 --> 41:01.880
inconvenient.

41:02.320 --> 41:04.450
Is it? I think it's pretty convenient.

41:04.550 --> 41:05.920
That's just your opinion.

41:05.920 --> 41:07.630
Other people definitely
won't see it that way.

41:07.630 --> 41:10.230
Tomorrow we're joining
the Shanlifang project,

41:10.230 --> 41:11.850
and we'll be on the same project team.

41:11.850 --> 41:13.630
If it's just colleagues, that's fine—

41:13.630 --> 41:15.960
but if people find out
we're living together,

41:15.960 --> 41:17.500
it'll be really hard to deal with.

41:17.500 --> 41:20.330
If it's hard to deal with,
then just don't deal with it. Right?

41:20.330 --> 41:21.390
Hold on, Landlady,

41:21.630 --> 41:22.800
why does it sound like

41:22.800 --> 41:25.660
you're trying to burn the bridge
after crossing it?

41:26.400 --> 41:28.930
I helped you get your position back,
didn't I?

41:29.510 --> 41:32.000
And now you're just kicking me out
like that?

41:32.000 --> 41:33.710
How could you do something like that?

41:33.710 --> 41:34.760
I wouldn't dare.

41:34.760 --> 41:36.220
You seem pretty bold to me.

41:36.550 --> 41:37.660
What's wrong with sharing a place?

41:37.660 --> 41:40.550
Male and female roommates
are totally normal nowadays.

41:40.550 --> 41:42.780
Why are you so conservative?
So outdated?

41:42.780 --> 41:44.640
No... It's just that...

41:44.960 --> 41:46.740
didn't we agree before?

41:46.770 --> 41:49.920
Once your financial situation
improves a bit,

41:49.920 --> 41:50.850
you'll move out.

41:52.190 --> 41:53.400
If you were even slightly frugal,

41:53.400 --> 41:54.630
the money you save would already

41:54.630 --> 41:56.150
be enough to rent a place
like mine on your own.

41:56.150 --> 41:58.760
Why do you insist
on sharing the apartment with me?

41:58.760 --> 42:00.150
What I said before is still valid.

42:00.150 --> 42:02.410
Once my finances improve,
I'll move out.

42:03.440 --> 42:05.300
Here—let me show you my finances.

42:07.030 --> 42:08.420
This is all the money in my accounts.

42:08.420 --> 42:09.920
If I had any money in my account,

42:09.920 --> 42:10.960
I'd move out in a heartbeat.

42:10.960 --> 42:12.030
-I'm not looking.
-Go ahead check and see.

42:12.030 --> 42:12.590
-I'm not checking.
-Check it.

42:12.590 --> 42:13.280
Come on, check it.

42:13.280 --> 42:14.940
-I'm not checking.
-Check it.

42:15.070 --> 42:17.400
Why would I even look at this?
Take it away.

42:17.710 --> 42:19.110
Not checking then? Fine.

42:19.150 --> 42:20.940
You do earn a decent salary,

42:21.070 --> 42:22.280
but you spend money like water.

42:22.280 --> 42:23.500
Where does it all go?

42:27.230 --> 42:29.960
Forget it—
I'll teach you how to save money

42:30.920 --> 42:32.190
so you can move out sooner.

42:32.190 --> 42:33.340
You're going to teach me to save money?

42:33.340 --> 42:35.420
Go on then, how do you plan to teach me?

42:37.360 --> 42:39.510
I'm best at saving money.

42:43.360 --> 42:44.030
Excuse me.

42:44.510 --> 42:45.800
Hey, we'd like to get this to go.

42:45.800 --> 42:46.400
Thank you.

42:47.360 --> 42:48.890
How much can that even save?

42:50.110 --> 42:51.510
Two days' worth of meals.

42:52.280 --> 42:53.670
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:55.360 --> 42:56.220
You two already knew

42:56.220 --> 42:58.030
Wang Ruohai had gone
to Shanlifang, didn't you?

42:58.030 --> 43:00.030
Shanlifang is the parent company
of Xinxin Vision,

43:00.030 --> 43:02.830
and Wang Ruohai has just
been appointed CFO there.

43:02.920 --> 43:04.920
Then why didn't you tell me earlier?

43:05.360 --> 43:06.220
Director Fang,

43:06.840 --> 43:09.240
I've run into some difficulties recently.

43:10.280 --> 43:12.190
Is there anyone in He Jing

43:12.190 --> 43:13.280
who could...

43:13.800 --> 43:14.880
be of help to you?

43:14.900 --> 43:16.450
What about someone like Qian Fei?

43:16.450 --> 43:17.980
If it's convenient for you,

43:18.070 --> 43:19.170
could we let her be my special assistant

43:19.170 --> 43:20.570
during our cooperation?

43:20.920 --> 43:21.960
What do you think?
